{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_05311","headline":"奉和九月九日登慈恩寺浮图应制 · 毕乾泰","name":"奉和九月九日登慈恩寺浮图应制","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"鹦林花塔启，凤辇顺时游。\n重九昭皇庆，大千扬帝休。\n耆闍妙法阐，王舍睿文流。\n至德覃无极，小臣歌讵酬。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"毕乾泰","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_05311.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_05311","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}